From 9f135a9da2742864a6f38bc72dac260fbf216bfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Serhii Nikolaichuk <nikolaichuk.s.f@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 09:40:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] tests: none on stand-ins

internal/tacra's backend tests ran the backend against a verifier, RRPs
and TLS servers of their own, and TestRefRequestsThroughServer against
a CA of its own with a self-made certificate. They go. The RATS models,
the choice of verifier and mutual TLS run against the live trust zone
in every attestation-bench hardware run and in its make check-mtls. The
EST media types and the Handle's encoding were checked only by these
tests and are not yet checked on the live server: attestation-bench
records that gap in its docs/limits.md. The tests on the reference
implementation's vectors stay.
---
 attest_ref_interop_test.go     | 121 ---------------
 internal/tacra/backend_test.go | 276 ---------------------------------
 2 files changed, 397 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 internal/tacra/backend_test.go

